WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.996
Read closely to identify the main idea and important supporting details; skim when

00:00:04.996 --> 00:00:06.472
looking for a gist.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:12.501
“An old tree shaded the school playground.” Which detail shows a benefit? Answer: It

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:13.619
shaded the playground.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:18.503
Highlight one topic sentence and list three details that support it.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.033
Discuss why: Shade is a benefit for learners.
